# Copy to docker/Dockerfile.dockerignore: BuildKit reads <Dockerfile>.dockerignore next to the Dockerfile
# (context = repo root). ALLOW-LIST: everything is out unless named; add what the Dockerfile needs
# (migrations/, templates/, ...). Gitignored private data, .env and .git/ never reach the build.
**
!go.mod
!go.sum
!*.go
!cmd/
!internal/
!pkg/
# Uncomment what the project has (other package dirs, //go:embed folders):
# !web/
# !migrations/
**/.env
**/.env.*
